wered accurately and include clickable links where appropriate. The initial question regarding the 네이버 지도 link is confirmed as 100% valid.\n\n\nExamining the provided data, the initial number is a virtual, secure number linked to Naver. Further investigation reveals the company operates under multiple names and has a publicly listed official representative number. The official representative number, 1577-7769, is the most appropriate for public use.\n\n\n"}
